cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'If you reference these scores or this definition, please cite them as below.'
title: 'aicareer.me — AI Career Risk Index and HI-C Definition Framework'
abstract: >-
  Two named, versioned, openly licensed reference works on how AI is reshaping
  careers. The AI Career Risk Index scores 24 professions for AI displacement
  risk across three weighted dimensions. The HI-C Definition Framework defines
  the High-Impact Individual Contributor — a senior professional with no direct
  reports who carries work from hypothesis to measurable outcome end to end,
  staffing adjacent functions with AI rather than with a team.
type: dataset
